WEBVTT

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.280
The land of Flonyard.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.410
On this continent, 
bathed in protective light,

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:30.000
the people are joyous
 and live in peace.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.030
However, this last spring,
 something unfortunate happened

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:39.270
in the south of the continent, 
in the Biscotti Republic.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:42.890
Thus, Princess 
Millihiore of Biscotti

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:45.890
summoned a champion 
from a faraway world.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.730
The person who answered 
her summons had a smile

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:57.950
for every person he met, and
 brought happiness into their hearts.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:03.160
Even though this hero returned to Earth

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.460
once his mission was over...

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:13.840
...he promised we would 
meet again in summer.

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:18.720
Now, summer has come.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:32.470
That's why the tale of love

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:34.860
and bravery of the hero,

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:37.820
and of us, will begin anew.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:21.050
7/22/2011, 7:05 AM
Earth / Japan, Kinokawa City, Tokino Ward

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:26.140
So, Sink, are you going to tell me now?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.890
<b>Kinokawa International School, 2nd year Middle School student
Placed 2nd in the "Iron Athletics" tournament last year
Sink Izumi</b>

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.150
What exactly?

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.900
<b>Kinokawa International School, 2nd year Middle School student
Rebecca Anderson (Sink's childhood friend)</b>

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.490
The destination of the upcoming trip!

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.090
I already told you.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.520
I can't tell you until we get there.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:43.280
Same day, 11:09 PM
Earth / Great Britain, City of London

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:46.440
Hi, Sink. It's me, Nanami.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.370
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:51.370
<b>Winner of the "Iron Athletics" tournament last year
Takatsuki Nanami
(Lives in London, Sink's cousin)</b>

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.630
Almost at the station.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.370
I just have to wait there, right?

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.270
<i>Yes.</i>

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:55.170
<i>The guide will escort you from there.</i>

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.680
Roger.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.670
What are we doing here?

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.020
Tatsumaki!

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.020
Sink!

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:06.010
I haven't seen you in forever.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.110
Sorry I kept you waiting, Becky.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:10.310
We're leaving for our trip from here.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:25.190
Here, kitty kitty.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.270
For me?

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.600
H-hey, Sink...

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.570
Here we go.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:38.080
Becky, the view is really great.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.520
Open your eyes and look!

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:45.780
No way!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:51.650
It's in the afternoon...

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:52.400
Is that the sea?

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:55.860
Wait, I'm in the sky?!

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:01.760
I'm sorry, Becky.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.020
Wait here for a sec, okay?

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.360
Sink...

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.870
Yes, Princess.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:22.700
Sink! Sink! Sink!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:25.680
Princess! I'm sorry I kept you waiting.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:27.860
I'm back, just like I promised!

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:28.800
Yup!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.190
Thank you for summoning me again.

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:37.890
But of course! Thank you for answering.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.400
I'm so glad you came again.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:42.060
Me, too.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.650
It's not just me though.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.400
There's also Nanami and Becky...

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:49.420
How is Rebecca-san?

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.530
Oh!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:54.540
I think she was a little too startled.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:57.530
Let's take her somewhere 
where she can rest.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.150
Is Nanami doing okay?

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:01.930
She is.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:06.650
I asked for her to be summoned 
onto the Galette premises,

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.880
so I'm sure Leo-sama is giving 
her a proper welcome.

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.530
So everyone's already...

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:25.580
As you can see.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:27.520
Our hero!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.030
Our hero!

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.230
Our hero!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:36.280
Sink! Welcome back!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.040
Jeez, you took too long.

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:46.870
Our hero!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:50.460
I am overjoyed that the summoning 
worked again without any problems!

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:53.720
That's because you did all 
the research necessary.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.030
Thanks, Rico.

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.880
Rico, stop hogging him!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:01.850
I'm going to hug him, too!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:03.850
Certainly.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.460
H-hey, Yukki, Yukki!

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:08.610
Eclair!

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:11.110
It's good to see you again, Eclair.

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:15.700
I came back earlier, 
just like I promised.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.420
I hope you'll train me in all 
sorts of subjects, again.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:21.960
It's going to be tougher than last time.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.280
Hero, hero!

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:29.210
Rebecca-dono is waking up.

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:34.720
Good morning, Becky.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.720
Huh? Sink?

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.290
Isn't it beautiful?

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.950
I wanted to bring you here so much.

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:58.200
Um, yes, I do think that 
it's very beautiful...

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:03.270
but the islands are floating 
and the sky is violet.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.750
Well, you'll get used to it...

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.420
So, can I introduce you 
to my friends here?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.150
Sure.

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:17.420
Princess! Everyone!

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:19.180
Yes!

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:25.450
It's so wonderful to 
meet you, Rebecca-sama!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.590
Nice to meet you.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:28.940
We welcome you.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.940
Hello... it's so nice to....

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:43.700
Welcome to Flonyard, Rebecca-san.

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:47.200
Thank you for coming to Biscotti!

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:54.000
Uh... yes, I mean... thank you...

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:00.630
Looks like it's about to start.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:01.300
Yeah.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.220
Then let's go back to the hall!

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:05.970
Yes!

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:07.920
Let's go!

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.280
Sink!

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.650
I've got so many questions!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.980
Don't worry, I'll explain everything.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.070
We're off, then!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.070
Our destination is Fournette, 
our battle-ground for the day!

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:25.400
Let's go!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:35.190
The sky is clear and it's 
another day perfect for war!

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:43.010
The main players have yet to arrive,

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:47.220
but the Biscotti vs Galette 
army battle has already begun!

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.070
We're your hosts today,

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:51.870
and we'll be bringing 
you all the action live!

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:55.050
We are Framboise Charley from the 
Galette National Broadcast and...

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:58.280
Percy Gaudi from the
 Biscotti National Broadcast!

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:05.370
Now, all of our wonderful guests 
we invited from both countries!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:09.620
<b>General of the Galette Lion Army
Leader of the Knights
Bernard Sabrage</b>

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.820
From Galette, we have their leader of 
the knights, Bernard Sabrage and...

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:09.960
Thank you.

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:12.210
Next to him, is Leo-sama's 
personal assistant, Violet-san.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:14.370
<b>Leader of the Galette Lion Army's Imperial Guard
Violet Amaret</b>

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.320
Hello.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:18.130
<b>Knights of Biscotti
Leader of the Knights
Rolan Martinozzi</b>

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:17.490
From Biscotti, we have their leader 
of the knights, Rolan Martinozzi.

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:18.310
Hello.

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:21.050
Mistress d'Arquien,
 leader of the Secret Squad.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:23.130
<b>Knights of Biscotti
Leader of the Secret Squad
Brioche d'Arquien</b>

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:22.560
Thank you for having me.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.590
With these members on board,

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.890
we'd now like to bring 
you the battle live!

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:29.280
That's right!

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.120
And today's battle is

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:35.170
"Welcome back, Hero! Special 
Welcoming Battle", is that right?

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:36.160
Yes.

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.910
Today's main character, 
the hero of Biscotti,

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.150
should be arriving shortly.

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:45.100
Our princess and the leader of the 
bodyguards are with them, as well.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:47.570
Leo-sama is on her way, too.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.330
And, of course, Prince Gaul.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.030
To everyone fighting in 
the battle right now;

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.640
to the knights, warriors, 
and regular participants,

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:02.270
once the Hero arrives, this arena
 is going to absolutely explode!

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:06.680
We recommend that you gather 
all the points you can now!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.320
<b>Knights of Galette, Gaul's personal guard
Imperial Guard Unit "Genoise"
Jaune Clafoutis</b>

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.250
All right, you've been 
waiting long enough.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.410
It's our turn now!

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:25.110
Unmatched in battle, 
Gaul-sama's personal guard!

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:25.070
<b>Knights of Galette, Gaul's personal guard
Imperial Guard Unit "Genoise"
Noir Vinocacao</b>

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.490
Who called us? Who named us?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.490
<b>Knights of Galette, Gaul's personal guard
Imperial Guard Unit "Genoise"
 Vert Far-Breton</b>

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:29.950
The three of us are:

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.990
Genoise!

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:38.800
And no matter what they 
say, he's our prince!

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:40.710
Everybody, call him!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:41.960
And a-one...

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:45.220
Prince Gaul!

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.470
Yeah!

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.500
I'm here!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:57.270
It's me!

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.690
So guys, I heard

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:05.110
that stupid hero was coming 
back to Biscotti today,

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.820
and I decided that I'm going 
to fight him personally!

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:11.080
But he has absolutely no intention

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.400
of letting him win because 
it's a welcoming match.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:15.340
We're gonna give it to both 
the hero and the knights.

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.920
Today's victory's going 
to Galette again!

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:20.540
So, all you Biscottians—

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:24.860
come and get it!

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.410
So this is... a war?

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.700
That's right!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.310
Or, as you would say on Earth,

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.470
it's "an athletic event 
sponsored by each country

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:44.380
and involving the
 general populace."

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.780
Sink did really great things

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:50.850
in these events when he 
was here last spring.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:54.160
He's our, that is to 
say Biscotti's, hero!

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:02.430
Sink... a hero?

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.290
That's right.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:07.170
And as Biscotti's hero, 
he saved Biscotti.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:13.930
I can see Sink being able to 
do well in events like these.

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:18.320
Yes, he proved to be an excellent hero.

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:22.140
That's so great.
 It looks like so much fun!

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:24.390
Then why don't you join?

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:25.490
Can I?!

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:29.900
To be perfectly honest, that is 
why we summoned you to our land.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:37.700
Takatsuki Nanami, would you like 
to try being Galette's hero?

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:05.600
Booyeah, we've cut 
through their defense!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.020
Now it's a straight shot 
to their stronghold.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:09.940
Troops, charge!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:17.240
It looks like His Highness Gaul 
and Genoise are advancing fast!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:18.940
The stronghold is right there!

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:21.250
It looks like the Biscotti 
camp is in trouble.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:22.660
Emi-rin!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.420
Are the captain and the 
hero still not here?

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:26.470
Don't despair, Ange!

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:27.980
I know they will come.

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:31.880
Gaul-sama, we're going ahead!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:39.110
Took you long enough!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:42.400
I'm here now!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.280
H-he...

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:58.210
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:01.370
I have answered the princess's 
and your summons....

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:08.580
Sink, reporting for duty!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:10.950
He's here!

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.270
The hero, Sink, has appeared.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.450
Sink...

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:18.550
Sink-kun...

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.820
Sink, welcome back.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.330
Jaune! Noir! Vert!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.580
It's good to see you again.

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.610
As promised, I trained hard.

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:38.120
In one moment?

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:40.620
I didn't even see it.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.870
He's been training too much.

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:44.870
It's really something.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:49.160
It is, but that's not 
enough to defeat us!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:12.200
It looks like the Genoise 
are out of the game for now!

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.780
That's what happens when you 
try to upstage the hero!

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:18.890
It looks like the leader 
of Biscotti's Secret Guard

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:21.420
and the Chief Researcher 
are both here, too!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:22.790
And...

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:29.140
the captain of our imperial guard, 
Eclair, has arrived as well!

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:35.170
It's been a long time, 
Sink, Hero of Biscotti.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.550
Your Excellency!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.180
Oh, it's Leo-sama!

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:41.950
I'm glad to see you've 
come back stronger.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.710
However, we won't be defeated.

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:49.940
If Biscotti is using a hero, 
might we not do the same?

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.110
Behold!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.960
This is the hero of the 
Galette Lion Army!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.120
I was summoned by Leo-sama.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.670
My name is Takatsuki Nanami,

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:30.350
here to fight as Galette's hero!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.100
I suspected Nanami-san would 
join the battle right away.

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:41.100
Would you like to participate, too?

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.620
You could be on artillery or archery!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:48.050
Oh no, I'm not good at this 
type of thing at all!

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:49.320
That's it!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.020
Why don't I introduce you

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:54.890
to everyone, since you 
came all the way here?

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:59.210
Oh, I am getting a message 
from Princess Millihiore!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.250
Hello!

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.720
I'm Millihiore, speaking to you 
from the Fournette fortress.

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:09.480
It looks like you're all having 
a lot of fun over there.

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:12.520
Here, we've got childhood friend

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.680
of both heroes: Rebecca Anderson!

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:19.440
Um, well... uh... hello!

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:23.910
Hello!

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:26.830
Becky!

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.120
Yes, yes...

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:41.630
Principality of Pastillage
Castle Eschenbach

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:39.370
Both armies have resumed their advance!

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:41.630
Is a direct clash imminent?!

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:46.250
They're really getting into it.

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:47.430
Quite so.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:50.930
Both countries summoned a hero...

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:55.190
Millihi-nee and Leo-nee 
are both unbelievable.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:55.190
<b>First Princess of the Principality of Pastillage
Feudal Lord of the Eschenbach Lands
Couverte E. Pastillage</b>

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:59.190
<b>Pastillage Crystal Technique Knights
Callaway Risler</b>

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:59.190
Everybody seems to be 
enjoying themselves.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:00.690
True...

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:07.160
Truth be told, I'd like Pastillage 
to join the fray with gusto, too.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.450
I concur.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:12.200
On the other hand, I'm not that...

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.640
This girl...

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:20.400
Yes, I hear she is the 
friend of both heroes.

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:22.210
A visitor from the other world.

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:23.450
I see.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.610
So she's not the hero of 
either country, right?

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.760
Yes, I believe so.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.020
This girl... she's good.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.770
My senses are tingling!

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:36.280
I'm going to go meet her!

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:39.770
Since we're going anyway, 
let's crash their battle, as well!

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:42.280
Certain— What?!

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:45.530
I'm coming to pick you up right now!

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:48.290
Just wait for me, my hero!

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:55.040
<b>A Hero Appears!</b>

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:32.290
Our hero's finally returned!

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:34.230
Since he's brought Rebecca-sama 
and Nanami-sama as well,

00:23:34.230 --> 00:23:36.440
it's going to be even more fun!

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:42.000
<b>Pastillage Joins The Battle!</b>

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:39.550
Let's get fired up 
together next time, too!
